@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Option Desk - Forward paper testing and ledger states
state "Open paper position" as Open
state "Mark requested" as Mark
state "Append complete mark\nand quality notes" as Marked
state "Report unmarkable\nkeep numeric P/L unavailable" as Missing
state "Closed paper position\nsettlement and close time" as Closed
[*] --> Open : open from a saved plan
Open --> Mark : mark
Mark --> Marked : all legs have marks
Mark --> Missing : chain or leg unavailable
Marked --> Open : keep open
Missing --> Open : keep open
Open --> Closed : close with ID and settlement price
Closed --> Closed : repeat close rejected
note left of Open
Entry preserves legs, prices, spot,
time, source plan and optional thesis.
Status reads the ledger.
end note
note right of Mark
Newest matching chain on disk.
Last-trade marks carry a quality note.
A missing quote is not zero.
end note
note bottom of Closed
Close uses intrinsic-payoff settlement.
It is not an early-close fill or a general two-expiry mark.
Expiry and quote freshness are not enforced by the command.
end note
caption Sources: shell cli/forward.py and engine backtest/forward.py. Paper results are not executions.
@enduml
